  // creature: the director never spends on him and nothing hunts him. On "chance" of nights he's at his easel out past one
  // of the line's stops beyond "pastGate" m of the gate: "out" m to the side away from its village or yard and "along" m
  // either way of where the train stops, "trackClearance" m clear of any track and "room" m of any wall. "blows" from one
