  //   boardSeconds (the telegraph; never under minReactionSeconds). A fireman at the fire can catch it there: a blow on the
  //   way in counts tenderBlowScale times over and doesn't burn (health 4: one blow drives it off).
  // - In (Stoker v3, the director's decision of 6 Oct 2026, GDD App. F.1; note 271): territorial. The heat it puts in swings:
  //   feedRate, plus or minus swing, over swingSeconds (the gauge lurching up toward the 100 that ruptures it), the safety
  //   valve held shut; the brake comes off and the speed climbs over runawayRampSeconds. eatPerSecond: of the fire it eats
  //   (0: it doesn't; v3 has the crew starve it). Whoever opens the door on it (a shovelful, within doorReach m of the door)
  //   takes doorBurn, and the second time doorKill: the mistake you learn from. No chip damage: it isn't clubbed in there.
  // - The counter: vent and starve. No coal, the blow-off held (the vent outruns its heat), until the fire's under
  //   starveFirebox; then it goes back over the footplate the way it came (boardSeconds) and is gone, and the break begins.
  // - The hose: Fire held into the firebox within doorReach for hoseSeconds opens the door without a burn and kills it, and
